    },
    {
      "id": "note_t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 612,
      "y": 916,
      "width": 866,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1028,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1029,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚠  Ops tools use the LB IP, not beta.leocdp.com.  leocdp.com is HSTS-preloaded (includeSubDomains), so browsers force valid-cert HTTPS on the whole host & every port — breaking the plain-HTTP (:3000 Dagster, :19999 Netdata, :5050 pgAdmin) and self-signed (:9443 Portainer) ops ports. Reach them at http(s)://103.245.254.29:<port>. Only the :443 Caddy front door has a trusted cert. Jaeger is the exception: fronted by Caddy at https://beta.leocdp.com/jaeger (SSO, TLS).",
      "originalText": "⚠  Ops tools use the LB IP, not beta.leocdp.com.  leocdp.com is HSTS-preloaded (includeSubDomains), so browsers force valid-cert HTTPS on the whole host & every port — breaking the plain-HTTP (:3000 Dagster, :19999 Netdata, :5050 pgAdmin) and self-signed (:9443 Portainer) ops ports. Reach them at http(s)://103.245.254.29:<port>. Only the :443 Caddy front door has a trusted cert. Jaeger is the exception: fronted by Caddy at https://beta.leocdp.com/jaeger (SSO, TLS).",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
