      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Caddy reverse proxy  ·  :443/:80  ·  TLS termination (auto Let’s Encrypt) + path routing\n/ → frontend   /c360api → api   /auth → keycloak   /ads → ads   /data → tracking   /jaeger → oauth2 (SSO)",
      "originalText": "Caddy reverse proxy  ·  :443/:80  ·  TLS termination (auto Let’s Encrypt) + path routing\n/ → frontend   /c360api → api   /auth → keycloak   /ads → ads   /data → tracking   /jaeger → oauth2 (SSO)",
